Z||000004||Monkeyman||06-12-2000||03:54 PM||||1st--Get a pen/pencil/crayon and a piece of paper.  <P>2nd--click on the "Reply w/ Quote" (last one) on Standards message.  Copy the URL for each one.  <P>3rd--Next time you want to use one of the new smilies, just copy the URL (is this what it's called?) onto your message.  Be sure to include the "[IMG]" things on each end.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lickout.gif"> <P><p>[This message has been edited by Monkeyman (edited 06-12-2000).]||||reg||1
